:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Dhalsim (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Dhalsim''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dhalsim
|image = E 485.png
|appearance = [[Illuminating Flame (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Dhalsim has low attack power, medium health, decent range and the ability to [[Weaken|weaken]] the attack power of cats by 50%. He is essentially a support enemy, so alone he is very easy to deal with.

==Strategy==
He is mainly used as a support enemy, so it's better to take care of frontliners first, but the best way of KO-ing him is to use high damage units or [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to get rid of him quickly.

